          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Code Shifter",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "- Iconic ASW characters remixed in 8-bit pixel art!\nCharacters from all the iconic Arc System Works franchises, including Guilty Gear, BlazBlue, and the River City series, all meet in a 2D pixel art action game!\nUtilize a whopping 100 characters to successfully adapt and complete all stages!\n\n- Brawl with up to 4 players!\nThe included \"COLORFUL FIGHTERS\" game mode features a brawler mini-game that allows up to 4 players to duke it out in a free-for-all!\nFight against other CPU controlled characters in the Ex Stages of the main story to unlock more playable characters!\nTry and unlock all 30 playable characters and win in epic brawling battles!!\n\n- You're a video game developer, and the deadline is quickly approaching!\nThe story takes place in the development offices of a software company, \"Awesome Rainbow Corp\".\nTrouble arises just as you're gearing up to release the final version of the game, many mysterious bugs are occurring, and time is running out!\n\nTo deal with this situation, a programmer, Stella, whips up a debug program: \"Code Shifter\", that let's her avatar \"Sera\" dive into the program and start fixing things up.\nWill Stella and her coworkers be able to find the origin of these bugs and deliver the game before the launch date?",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2020",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
